      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• result real? → validity gate\n  2684 pass tainted: forbidden network install\n• harness bug → Engineering\n  reply formats: 99.5% parsed after 3 fixes\n• broken task → Data:\n  graders 1634 / 1789 / 1702\n• training data → SFT export\n  7 clean passing conversations\n• model limits → next question\n  cyber: 1 of 6 reproduced the crash",
      "fontSize": 13.5,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "p-59",
      "originalText": "• result real? → validity gate\n  2684 pass tainted: forbidden network install\n• harness bug → Engineering\n  reply formats: 99.5% parsed after 3 fixes\n• broken task → Data:\n  graders 1634 / 1789 / 1702\n• training data → SFT export\n  7 clean passing conversations\n• model limits → next question\n  cyber: 1 of 6 reproduced the crash",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
