      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Hand-read a small blind sample\nof every run (e.g. 5 traces,\nstratified: pass / fail / oddity),\nscore agreement, keep the numbers.\n\nDone for probe-03 and the wedge rule.\nReef's 5-trace audit found\n4 corrections + 2 omissions.",
