      "text": "Change one thing at a time.\nHarness changes go before the baseline,\nor the baseline goes stale.",
      "fontSize": 13.5,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "p-112",
      "originalText": "Change one thing at a time.\nHarness changes go before the baseline,\nor the baseline goes stale.",
